---
import ProductCrop from './ProductCrop.astro';

---
<section class="identify-section" id="identify">
<div class="wrap identify-layout">
<figure class="identify-proof">
<div class="screen">
<ProductCrop name="identify.jpg" box="75 205 930 1655" width={1080} height={1920} alt="Existing published identification artwork: a likely Common Bream suggestion with a Change species control. This example is not an accuracy claim." class="" />
</div>
<figcaption>Published ID artwork · example result</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="section-copy">
<p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP, IF YOU NEED IT</p>
<h2>Not sure of<br>
<em>the species?</em>
</h2>
<p>A photo can give you a likely species suggestion. Check it, change it if needed, then save the catch.</p>
<p>Or simply record it yourself. Identification is always optional.</p>
<span class="note-line">A suggestion, never a guarantee.</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
